# MandoMC foundation
Read AGENTS.md and docs/status.md at session start.
Use docs/architecture.md for gameplay ownership and vendor boundaries.
Follow docs/style-guide.md for Java, configuration and player messages.
Keep branches small and update docs/status.md before a pause.
Example: a blaster change includes its WeaponMechanics config, protection check and play-test result.
